<title>UK: Carpetright to pay 8.9 mln stg for premises.</title>
<headline>Carpetright to pay 8.9 mln stg for premises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK carpet retailers Carpetright Plc said on Wednesday that it would buy the freehold of its premises at Rainham, Essex for 8.9 million stg from Estates and Agency Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>The company said the the premises comprised an aggregate warehouse area of 125,000 square feet and some 34,000 square feet of offices.</p>
<p>The yield on this property would be an intial seven percent and there is space within the site for further development, the companys said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
